# project-index
Quick reference — read this before working on the project to avoid scanning every file.

## Blocks & BlockEntities (ModBlocks.java / ModBlockEntities.java)
| Block ID           | Class               | BlockEntity               | Tier/Notes                   |
|--------------------|---------------------|---------------------------|------------------------------|
| controller_t1      | ControllerBlock(1)  | ControllerBlockEntity     | 25-block scan radius         |
| controller_t2      | ControllerBlock(2)  | ControllerBlockEntity     | 50-block scan radius         |
| controller_t3      | ControllerBlock(3)  | ControllerBlockEntity     | 100-block scan radius        |
| controller_t4      | ControllerBlock(4)  | ControllerBlockEntity     | 200-block scan radius        |
| machine_soul       | MachineSoulBlock    | MachineSoulBlockEntity    | Multi-tab GUI, complex state |
| commander          | CommanderBlock      | CommanderBlockEntity      | Filter + alliance key        |
