Unregistered / Legacy / Helper records (In network/ package but not registered in ModPackets):
- AssignMachineSoulSlotPacket (Unused, logic replaced by SaveMachineSoulMovePacket/SaveMachineSoulActionPacket)
- OpenMachineSoulGuiPacket (Client/Server helper, triggers OpenMachineSoulHomePacket.openFor)
- OpenMachineSoulHomePacket (Helper record, uses player.openMenu to open the home screen on the server)

Packet pattern: record implementing CustomPacketPayload, static TYPE (CustomPacketPayload.Type) + CODEC (StreamCodec), static handle() method.

## Capabilities (CapabilityProvider.java)
- CONTROLLER: exposes IItemHandler (Capabilities.ItemHandler.BLOCK) via be.getInventory()
- CARTRIDGE_COLLECTOR: exposes read-only IItemHandler (extract only, no insert) for collecting createbigcannons cartridges
- Uses RegisterCapabilitiesEvent — NOT ICapabilityProvider / @AttachCapabilitiesEvent

## Compat (compat/)
- SableCompat.java: Sable aeronautics sublevel integration for coordinates translation in physics structures

## Config
- CBCAutoTargetConfig.java — NeoForge server config (ModConfig.Type.SERVER)
  Config fields: scan_interval_ticks, max_sim_ticks, muzzle_speed_blocks_per_tick, default_gravity, default_drag, barrel_length, max_raycast_candidates
- Registered in CBCAutoTarget constructor via modContainer.registerConfig()

## Utilities (util/)
- BallisticSolver.java — ballistic trajectory math using Brent's method solver
- LineOfSightUtil.java — Line of sight checks helper
- ShipAimSolver.java — Create Aeronautics ship aiming coordinate conversion calculations

